# sUPI TDP — repository exclusions

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Distribution D hold
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source files bearing Distribution D markings, plus all native Creo files.
# Verified by text scan: drawing PDFs 13122514-13122518 carry the Distribution D
# block; every .prt.1 part file and the .asm.1 assembly contain Distribution D
# text as well (the .frm.1 drawing format does not). Corrected Distribution A
# drawings and STEP models live in "sUPI Mechanicals/" and ARE tracked.
sUPI Mechanicals/_DistD_hold/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Superseded originals, pending manual deletion
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pre-correction copies. Kept only until reviewed, then delete the folder.
sUPI Mechanicals/_to_delete/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal working record
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Audit trail of what was altered in preparing the Distribution A package.
# Internal prep artifact, not part of the released TDP. Nothing in the tracked
# files references it, so excluding it leaves no dangling links.
RELEASE_CHANGES.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Superseded source documents
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Converted to Markdown; the .md versions carry the corrections and are tracked.
# Change Log.docx additionally carries the originator's name in
# docProps/core.xml and a Microsoft Purview sensitivity label in
# docMetadata/LabelInfo.xml, neither of which is visible on the page.
Change Log.docx
sUPI_Payload_Brief.pdf
sUPI_Platform_Brief.pdf
sUPI Electrical/*.pdf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Debug-symbol image. supi_firmware.hex is the deliverable.
sUPI Firmware/*.axf
